      "path": "src/ui/screens/AboutView.tsx",
      "content": "A successful durability request only updates the shell through `onStorageKept`; About's `status` is still the snapshot fetched on mount. Consequently the card announces that the browser will keep the data while “Storage protection” below still says “Best effort” until the user leaves and reopens About. Refresh About's status (or update its protection field) in the success callback as well as notifying the shell.",
