      "end_line": 52,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/AppShell.tsx",
      "content": "A successful durability request during onboarding is not propagated to the shell. This card hides its warning locally, but `onReady` only changes `status.onboarding`, retaining the original `BestEffort` protection, and `storageKept` remains false because no `onKept` callback is supplied. Consequently the warning icon appears immediately after onboarding despite the browser having agreed to keep the data (and remains even after About reads the updated Protected status). Propagate success here to the shell or refresh Workspace status before leaving onboarding.",
      "existing_code": "        \u003cStorageProtectionCard facade={facade} protection={status.protection} /\u003e\n        \u003cOnboardingAccount",
      "start_line": 287,
