      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/StorageProtectionCard.tsx",
      "content": "The request outcome now lives in a route-local component, so leaving About and returning discards it. After a declined request, the result notice disappears and the request button reappears; previously the shell retained the outcome across navigation. Keep the durability outcome in session-level state (and pass it into the card) so navigating does not erase the result or reset the single-request action.",
